{"id": "unknown-2026-11-22-004", "date": "2026-11-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Thornova Solar and Nextpower strengthen strategic cooperation", "content": "<p>Solar module manufacturer Thornova Solar and Nextpower, a provider of advanced solar tracker and structural solutions, marked a milestone in their growing strategic cooperation with the signing of a Master Supply Agreement (MSA). The agreement, announced at RE+ 2026, further strengthens the collaboration between the two companies, combining Thornova Solar&#8217;s U.S.-made solar modules with Nextpower&#8217;s&#8230;</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.solarpowerworldonline.com/2026/11/thorno", "sources": [{"name": "solar_power_world", "url": "https://www.solarpowerworldonline.com/2026/11/thornova-solar-and-nextpower-strengthen-strategic-cooperation/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-22-005", "date": "2026-11-22", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 47, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "DTE Energy plans up to 150 megawatts of Michigan-based solar generation", "content": "<p>DTE Energy recently announced plans to add up to 150 megawatts of new solar energy in Michigan, a move that will create construction jobs, support local communities, and save customers money on fuel costs, the company said. In addition, because solar generation does not require fuel, the new projects will help reduce the company’s exposure&#8230;</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.solarpowerworldonline.com/2026/11/dte-energy-plans-up-to-150-megawatts-of-michigan-based-solar-generation/\">DTE", "sources": [{"name": "solar_power_world", "url": "https://www.solarpowerworldonline.com/2026/11/dte-energy-plans-up-to-150-megawatts-of-michigan-based-solar-generation/", "type": "rss"}]}
